\cf0 An earlier version of this article referred to the data used in the analyses as data from The Democracy Fund + UCLA Nationscape Project (see Tausanovitch, Vavreck, Hayes, Holliday, Reny, and Rudkin (2021) for a\'a0description of this project). Data for the analyses presented in the original article were collected as part of The Democracy Fund + UCLA Nationscape Project but were not based on the public release of Nationscape data. The original data used here included some interviews that were eventually excluded from the public release of Nationscape data and therefore did not exactly match any of the public releases of Nationscape data. In this corrigendum we have updated the analysis with the publicly released dataset which was released on December 14, 2021 and can be found here: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.voterstudygroup.org/data/nationscape"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 https://www.voterstudygroup.org/data/nationscape}}. We have updated our Harvard Dataverse, posted supplemental appendix, and replication file accordingly. Please note that geographic identifiers are not part of the public release and may be obtained from the project investigators upon request.\
